  "snippet": "Skip to Main Content\nHome\nMenu\nUpdates\nContact Us\nIdly\n\nIdly Set\n\nA classic serving of three soft, fluffy steamed idlis, perfect for a light and comforting meal.\n\nLittle Idly\n\nBite-sized mini idlis generously dipped in aromatic sambar for a comforting South Indian favorite.\n\nPlain Thatte Idly\n\nTraditional Karnataka-style plate idlis, extra soft, thick, and steamed to perfection.\n\nGuntur Podi Idly\n\nTwo soft steamed idlis coated with authentic Guntur chili podi and ghee, delivering a bold, spicy Andhra-style flavor in every bite.\n\nGhee Podi Thatte Idly\n\nA soft thatte idly topped with aromatic podi and pure ghee, offering a rich and flavorful experience.\n\nMix n' Match\n\nChoose your favorite podi combination - Classic, Karivepillai, or Garlic - for a customized flavor adventure.\n\nLittle Idly Kondattam\n\nMini idlis tossed with your choice of podi, delivering a flavorful and snackable South Indian delight.\n\nDosa\n\nMasala Dosa\n\nRava Masala Dosa\n\nMysore Masala Dosa\n\nBeetroot Dosa\n\nGhee Roast Dosa\n\nRagi Dosa\n\nUthappam\n\nTiffin Set\n\nIdiyappam\n\nPoori Masala\n\nCoconut Sevai\n\nLemon Sevai\n\nTamarind Sevai\n\nTomato Sevai\n\nSuper Savours\n\nIdly & Vada Set\n\nMini Tiffin\n\nPanchathanthiram Little Dosa\n\nShop no: 5,6&7, Al blouki building:105, plot no: 219-0 - 70 4C St - Al Karama - Dubai - United Arab Emirates\n\nTel: 971 4 244 4359\n\nsupport@littleidly.ae\n\n© 2026 Little Idly Restaurant. All rights reserved.",
  "fullText": "Skip to Main Content\nHome\nMenu\nUpdates\nContact Us\nIdly\n\nIdly Set\n\nA classic serving of three soft, fluffy steamed idlis, perfect for a light and comforting meal.\n\nLittle Idly\n\nBite-sized mini idlis generously dipped in aromatic sambar for a comforting South Indian favorite.\n\nPlain Thatte Idly\n\nTraditional Karnataka-style plate idlis, extra soft, thick, and steamed to perfection.\n\nGuntur Podi Idly\n\nTwo soft steamed idlis coated with authentic Guntur chili podi and ghee, delivering a bold, spicy Andhra-style flavor in every bite.\n\nGhee Podi Thatte Idly\n\nA soft thatte idly topped with aromatic podi and pure ghee, offering a rich and flavorful experience.\n\nMix n' Match\n\nChoose your favorite podi combination - Classic, Karivepillai, or Garlic - for a customized flavor adventure.\n\nLittle Idly Kondattam\n\nMini idlis tossed with your choice of podi, delivering a flavorful and snackable South Indian delight.\n\nDosa\n\nMasala Dosa\n\nRava Masala Dosa\n\nMysore Masala Dosa\n\nBeetroot Dosa\n\nGhee Roast Dosa\n\nRagi Dosa\n\nUthappam\n\nTiffin Set\n\nIdiyappam\n\nPoori Masala\n\nCoconut Sevai\n\nLemon Sevai\n\nTamarind Sevai\n\nTomato Sevai\n\nSuper Savours\n\nIdly & Vada Set\n\nMini Tiffin\n\nPanchathanthiram Little Dosa\n\nShop no: 5,6&7, Al blouki building:105, plot no: 219-0 - 70 4C St - Al Karama - Dubai - United Arab Emirates\n\nTel: 971 4 244 4359\n\nsupport@littleidly.ae\n\n© 2026 Little Idly Restaurant. All rights reserved.",
